Just a hey. [p]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_lookout.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
I’m busy here, unlike some people. [p]
#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#cc66ff">Klaus</font>
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus_pathetic.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
The grumpy little boy over there is Alexeï. [l]He’s the technical staff I mentioned to you earlier. [l][p]
[chara_mod name="Klaus" storage="/chara/2/klaus.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
[l]He’s a scientist and astronaut, just like you, and also a computer genius. [p]
He makes up for his lack of social abilities with hard work and diligence. [l]He might growl, but he doesn’t bite. [p]

#<font face="earthorbiter"><font color="#ff8080">Euphie</font>
[image storage=default/EuphieSprites/euphie_normal_smile.png layer=2 x=35 y=458 visible=true time=0 width=181 height=217]
Nice to meet you. [l]I’m Euphémia. [l]I’m an astronaut and scientist. [p]
[freeimage layer=2]

#<font face="EarthOrbiter"<font color="#66ccff">Alexeï</font>
[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex_thinking.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
Looking forward to working with you. [p]
[freeimage layer=1]

[current layer="message1"]
[layopt layer="message0" visible=false]
[layopt layer="message1" visible=true]

