[chara_mod name="Alexei" storage="/chara/4/alex.png" wait=true time=200 cross=false]
...Now if you could let me get back to work.[l] I have to finish this before lunch time, and other people’s presence is keeping me away from concentrating. [p]
[freeimage layer=1]
